# =========================================================
# Custom Block & Anti-PCDN Payload (rules/Block.list)
# 覆盖：百度网盘、抖音/字节、快手、B站、迅雷、爱优腾、淘宝直播、网易云等
# 原则：只杀 P2P/PCDN/HCDN/MCDN 边缘吸血调度，100% 保留官方主 CDN (零黑屏)
# =========================================================

# --- 1. 全局 PCDN / HCDN / MCDN / P2P 强特征关键字通杀 ---
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,pcdn
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,mcdn
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,hcdn
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,p2pchunk
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,p2plive
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,p2pvod
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,p2p-ali
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,p2p-hw
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,dyp2p
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,yfp2p
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,trackercdn

# --- 2. 抖音 / 西瓜视频 / 字节跳动系 PCDN 与直播 P2P ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bytefcdn.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bytep2p.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,bdp2p.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,p2p.toutiao.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,p2p.snssdk.com
DOMAIN,pull-hs-f5-hot.flive.douyincdn.com
DOMAIN,pull-rtmp-l11.ixigua.com
DOMAIN,push-rtmp-l1.ixigua.com

# --- 3. 百度网盘 / 百度系 PCDN 专属调度 ---
